Package: ProstateAtlasMapR
Title: Reference Mapping and Spatial Deconvolution for the Prostate Atlas
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lei", "Tang", email = "tanglei@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Build a lightweight reference from a prostate single-cell atlas
    and (1) map new single-cell datasets onto it with Seurat's anchor-based
    workflow (FindTransferAnchors + MapQuery), preserving the atlas umap.rpca
    coordinates, or (2) run spacexr RCTD deconvolution on spatial
    transcriptomics data. Includes focused plotting helpers for prediction
    scores and RCTD weights. Users choose annotation level H1/H2/H3 at call
    time. The lean reference object is distributed separately from this
    package (GitHub Releases: prostate_atlas_reference.qs).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
